    v - Start Speech-to-Text for selected Unit

    m - Show/Hide
    Area

    h - Open Help Menu

    NumPad5 - Lower Shown Tilemap

    NumPad8
    - Heighten Shown Tilemap

    NumPad6 - GoToNext Unit/Building of selected Type

    NumPad4
    - GoToLast Unit/Building of selected Type

    tab - show all players

    ....
    - Show/Hide Buildings'
